03. Respect the community
Harassment, threats and targeted abuse are not acceptable.
04. Follow event rules
Event-specific restrictions and objectives apply when announced.
05. No impersonation
Do not impersonate staff or mislead players about official decisions.
06. Check official updates
Read the full, current rules in Discord. Staff decisions and detailed rules are published there.
